    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pxjo4hd",
      "content": "• Cytoplasm is the jelly-like substance inside the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dumwkta",
      "content": "• It contains organelles that perform different functions."
    },
    {
      "id": "1r8fzz1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Nucleus"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "97ek263",
      "content": "• Nucleus controls the activities of the cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9ofcifz",
      "content": "• It contains genetic material (DNA)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tdb1gmq",
      "content": "• It regulates cell division."
    },
